writing selectors in substituted initializers](#discussion_r4106380115) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Preserve template-generated argument and receiver identifiers](#discussion_r4106380151) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Avoid rewriting selectors in substituted field values](#discussion_r4106380192) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Preserve target-derived identifiers during alias substitution](#discussion_r4106380232) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Exclude unrelated selectors from generated import alias scanning](#discussion_r4106380284) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Load test variants for otelc go test dependencies](#discussion_r4106380314) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nBuilds a package-name table during setup so matching and generated instrumentation use declared package names and existing aliases instead of path-derived guesses.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Collects, stores, and loads resolved dependency package names.\n- Threads resolved names through matching and instrumentation.\n- Rewrites generated qualifiers to reuse existing aliases, with expanded tests.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `tool/​util/​shared.go` | Adds import-name table path. |\r\n| `tool/​util/​shared_test.go` | Tests the new path. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​store.go` | Persists resolved names. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​store_test.go` | Tests persistence errors. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​setup.go` | Loads dependency graphs and collects names. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​match.go` | Uses resolved names during rule matching. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​filter.go` | Passes names into function filters. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​pkgload/​pkgload.go` | Collects names transitively. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​pkgload/​pkgload_test.go` | Tests graph traversal. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​toolexec.go` | Loads names for compilation. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​toolexec_test.go` | Tests load failures. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​optimize_test.go` | Updates alias-map calls. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​match.go` | Reads the persisted table. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​match_test.go` | Tests table loading. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​instrument_test.go` | Updates function matching calls. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​imports.go` | Adds alias resolution and rewriting. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​imports_test.go` | Tests alias helpers. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_struct.go` | Rewrites aliases in added fields. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_struct_test.go` | Tests struct-field aliases. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_raw.go` | Rewrites aliases in raw snippets. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_raw_test.go` | Tests raw-rule aliases. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_lit.go` | Rewrites literal-rule expressions. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_lit_test.go` | Tests literal aliases. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_func.go` | Uses resolved names and pruned imports. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_func_test.go` | Tests function-rule imports. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_directive.go` | Rewrites directive output aliases. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_directive_test.go` | Tests directive aliases. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_decl.go` | Rewrites declaration expressions. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_decl_test.go` | Tests declaration aliases. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_call.go` | Rewrites call-rule qualifiers. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​instrument/​apply_call_test.go` | Tests call matching and aliases. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​ast/​typename.go` | Resolves import aliases from real names. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​ast/​typename_test.go` | Tests resolved and fallback aliases. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​ast/​shared.go` | Threads names through signature matching. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​ast/​shared_test.go` | Updates matching tests. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/1312#pullrequestreview-5319899728","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/1312","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/1312#pullrequestreview-5319899728"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/1312"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-25T16:08:58Z","commit_id":"6bd8f8a794fd37e9cc88c434e8e6a7e2af9b6624"}]